{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:30 2026-10-17 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:30 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:30 2026-10-17 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cbc2d2ad43a46cd5c7be76f3f262c439/2026-10/2026-10-17_00_23_38.png\"/><p>粉嶺發生兒童猝死事件。今日（17日）清晨6時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其11歲兒子在吉祥街8號欣翠花園一個單位內昏迷不醒，遂立即召喚救援人員到場。</p><p>救護員趕抵單位後，經檢查證實男童已明顯死亡，毋須送院。警方其後封鎖現場調查，證為事件無可疑。</p><p>男童死因仍在調查中。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T23:39:13.589966+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T23:30:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T01:37:44.157765+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T23:37:37.179457+00:00","content_hash":"7260b7e7d80c8f1ce2bdfc2cc295b674fe8613b48d29a74a39292fc479a42508","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}